enosc3 is a modified version of the Ensemble Oscillator firmware, with
synthesis code ported from Mutable Instruments Plaits. It is not an
official release of 4ms Company or Mutable Instruments.

Modifications Copyright (c) 2026 the enosc3 contributors, under the same
BSD 2-clause terms as the Ensemble Oscillator source code below.

